**Known for**: Hyprland

**Alias**: Vaxry

Rafał Kucharski is the "edgy" founder and maintainer of the Hyprland Wayland
compositor. He oversees a toxic community and participates in hate and bigotry,
particularly towards LGBTQ+ folks.[[source]][0] Downplayed an incident where
moderators of his Discord server changed the pronouns of a trans person to
deliberately misgender them, saying "on the Internet, let's be real, [he] is
the default".[[source]][1]

Got banned from freedesktop.org after losing his shit when they privately warned
him not to be a toxic jerk in their community spaces.[[source]][2] Hates codes of conduct
and inclusivity in FOSS.[[source]][3]

Funded by Framework,[[source]][4] speaker at
[David Heinemeier Hansson]($link.page('weird-guys').unsafeRef('dhh'))'s Omacon
2026.[[source]][5]

